A||||7||8Ball||Would BOT reccomend this product!!!||||1||
Z||000000||8Ball||11-24-2001||04:51 PM||||(Dangit!! I hate when I typo the topic!!!)<P>The autozone around here just started carrying Castrol engine degreaser in a purple spray bottle. They swear by it of coarse and it was a descent price. Like 3.50 I think. But!!!! I sprayed my entire engine with it and cleaned it off really well only to find my plenium and valve covers are now PINK!!!!!<P>So tomorrow I will have to try to buff them back out. What a joy   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>E.B.<p>[This message has been edited by 8Ball (edited 11-24-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jay||11-24-2001||05:00 PM||||That's why it probably says to test the contents on an small area first.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Hope you can bring them back to life.<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig2_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfiero||11-24-2001||05:35 PM||||Who's BOT and why is his recommendation so important?  j/k  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>If the paint has faded to a pink color then I think there is probably little hope of making it red again.  I hope I'm wrong though.  Good luck. ||||reg||12
Z||000003||Pontiaddict||11-24-2001||06:24 PM||||I remember Castrol Superclean. That stuff works great. But I'm pretty sure that it removed the pigment from the paint deep enough that you're going to be better off repainting. The last time I've seen it fade paint was on a Ford straight 6. Some of it splashed on the new paint of the block and turned it from Ford blue to Pontiac blue.||||reg||1
Z||000004||banditbalz||11-24-2001||06:32 PM||||The reason the red  faded is the product you used has trace amounts of some form of solvent or another. Most typical being Naptha, Xylene, toluol or even Laquar thinner.<BR>This may sound goofy, but i've always used a litle motor oil (teaspoon) on a cloth and rub away... looks as if the paint on the plenum is still wet. Has won me many an award!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blackwhite2_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
